{"case_id": "m01", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Prime factorisation**\n\n$$84 = 2^2 \\times 3 \\times 7$$\n\n$$126 = 2 \\times 3^2 \\times 7$$\n\n**HCF** = product of common prime factors (lowest power)\n\n$$\\text{HCF} = 2 \\times 3 \\times 7 = \\boxed{42}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.778, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 457, "output_tokens": 243, "reasoning_tokens": 156, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-19T17:48:21"}
{"case_id": "m02", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**LCM of 12 and 18**\n\nPrime factorisation:\n\n$$12 = 2^2 \\times 3^1$$\n$$18 = 2^1 \\times 3^2$$\n\nTake the highest power of each prime:\n\n$$\\text{LCM} = 2^2 \\times 3^2 = 4 \\times 9 = \\boxed{36}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.79, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 433, "output_tokens": 184, "reasoning_tokens": 89, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-19T17:48:21"}
{"case_id": "m03", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Total number of parts:**\n2 + 3 + 4 = 9\n\n**Value of one part:**\nR360 ÷ 9 = R40\n\n**Largest share (4 parts):**\n4 × R40 = **R160**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.623, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 524, "output_tokens": 158, "reasoning_tokens": 96, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-19T17:48:22"}
{"case_id": "m41", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**Formula:**\n\n$$T_n = a + (n-1)d$$\n\n**Substitute:**\n\n$$T_{25} = 7 + (25 - 1)(4)$$\n\n$$= 7 + 24(4)$$\n\n$$= 7 + 96$$\n\n$$= \\boxed{103}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.771, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 445, "output_tokens": 209, "reasoning_tokens": 130, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-19T17:48:22"}
{"case_id": "m42", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**Arithmetic series**\n\nFirst term: $a = 3$\n\nCommon difference: $d = 7 - 3 = 4$\n\nNumber of terms: $n = 20$\n\n$$S_{n} = \\frac{n}{2}\\big(2a + (n-1)d\\big)$$\n\n$$S_{20} = \\frac{20}{2}\\big(2(3) + (20-1)(4)\\big)$$\n\n$$= 10\\big(6 + 76\\big)$$\n\n$$= 10(82)$$\n\n$$\\boxed{S_{20} = 820}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.891, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 453, "output_tokens": 317, "reasoning_tokens": 164, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-19T17:48:23"}
{"case_id": "m43", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**Geometric sequence:** 2; 6; 18; …\n\n**First term:** $a = 2$\n\n**Common ratio:** $r = \\frac{6}{2} = 3$\n\n**Formula:**\n$$T_n = a \\times r^{(n-1)}$$\n\n**Substitute:**\n$$T_8 = 2 \\times 3^{(8-1)}$$\n$$T_8 = 2 \\times 3^7$$\n$$T_8 = 2 \\times 2187$$\n\n$$\\boxed{T_8 = 4374}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.948, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 507, "output_tokens": 341, "reasoning_tokens": 202, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-19T17:48:23"}
{"case_id": "m04", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Average speed** = distance ÷ time\n\n= 240 km ÷ 3 h\n\n= **80 km/h**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.558, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 519, "output_tokens": 101, "reasoning_tokens": 69, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:31:39"}
{"case_id": "m05", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Simple Interest**\n\n**Formula:** SI = P × r × t\n\n**Substitute:**\nSI = 5 000 × 0,08 × 3\n\n**Calculate:**\nSI = 5 000 × 0,24\n\n**SI = R1 200**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.85, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 492, "output_tokens": 240, "reasoning_tokens": 169, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:31:39"}
{"case_id": "m44", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "Given: $16 + 8 + 4 + \\ldots$\n\nIdentify:\nFirst term: $a = 16$\nCommon ratio: $r = \\frac{8}{16} = \\frac{1}{2}$\n\nSince $|r| < 1$, the sum to infinity exists.\n\n$$S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$$\n\n$$S_\\infty = \\frac{16}{1 - \\frac{1}{2}}$$\n\n$$S_\\infty = \\frac{16}{\\frac{1}{2}}$$\n\n$$\\boxed{S_\\infty = 32}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.851, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 440, "output_tokens": 281, "reasoning_tokens": 132, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:31:39"}
{"case_id": "m45", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "## Solution\n\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{10}(2k+1)$$\n\n**Method:** Split the sum.\n\n$$= \\sum_{k=1}^{10}2k + \\sum_{k=1}^{10}1$$\n\n$$= 2\\sum_{k=1}^{10}k + 10$$\n\nUsing $\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$:\n\n$$= 2 \\cdot \\frac{10(10+1)}{2} + 10$$\n\n$$= 2(55) + 10$$\n\n$$= 110 + 10$$\n\n$$= \\boxed{120}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.423, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 508, "output_tokens": 393, "reasoning_tokens": 221, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:31:39"}
{"case_id": "m16", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Geometry of Straight Lines"], "output": "Angles on a straight line sum to 180°.\n\n$$180° - 125° = 55°$$\n\n**The other angle is 55°.**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.873, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 507, "output_tokens": 102, "reasoning_tokens": 58, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:09:46"}
