{"case_id": "m13", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Decimal Fractions"], "output": "**0,6 × 0,4**\n\n6 × 4 = 24\n\nTotal decimal places: 1 + 1 = 2\n\n∴ 0,6 × 0,4 = **0,24**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.042, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 519, "output_tokens": 229, "reasoning_tokens": 175, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:09:47"}
{"case_id": "m11", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Common Fractions"], "output": "$$\\frac{3}{4} + \\frac{2}{3}$$\n\nCommon denominator: $4 \\times 3 = 12$\n\n$$= \\frac{9}{12} + \\frac{8}{12}$$\n\n$$= \\frac{17}{12}$$\n\n$$= 1\\tfrac{5}{12}$$\n\n**Answer: $1\\tfrac{5}{12}$**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.159, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 534, "output_tokens": 262, "reasoning_tokens": 164, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:09:47"}
{"case_id": "m50", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "groq:qwen__qwen3.8-27b@low", "model": "groq:qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Exponential and logarithmic functions", "grade12"], "output": "**Solution:**\n\n$$\\log_2 x = 5$$\n\nRewrite in exponential form:\n\n$$x = 2^5$$\n\n$$\\boxed{x = 32}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 0.547, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 494, "output_tokens": 133, "reasoning_tokens": 89, "cost_usd": 0, "served_models": ["qwen/qwen3.8-27b"], "hosts": ["groq"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:09:47"}
